  "releaseNotes": "This tool provides an advanced GUI to create, edid, assign and generate documentation for Dataverse security roles.\n\t\t\tv1.2026.1.6: First version.\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\tMain features:\n\t\t\t- Create new roles or edit existing security roles with an advanced UI\n\t\t\t- Create and use privilege templates (a set of predefined privileges to be assigned to tables)\n\t\t\t- Predefined privilege templates\n\t\t\t- Clone roles\n\t\t\t- Check if a given role is actually used\n\t\t\t- Assign role to a user/team\n\t\t\t- Contextual help\n\n\t\t\t* For older releases go here: https://github.com/neronotte/Greg.Xrm/releases",
